{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Qwen via Model Studio and reading company documents from OSS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","dify-on-ack","ack","model-studio","oss","milvus","rds","tair","nat","sls"]}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Frankfurt","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"access","text":"Internal-only assistant accessed over corporate network","alt":"Public-facing with WAF"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 500 internal employees","alt":"Over 5000 employees"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Corporate users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Internal staff asking questions to the knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes internal traffic to the Dify cluster across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Managed Kubernetes running all Dify components."}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify","group":"vpc","attachTo":"ack","why":"Self-hosted low-code agent and RAG builder for the knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"say","text":"Dify calls Qwen through Model Studio and reads vectors from Milvus for RAG."}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"frankfurt","why":"Hosts Qwen models that Dify calls for generation and embedding."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-model-studio","from":"ack","to":"model-studio","label":"API"}
{"t":"node","id":"milvus","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus vector store","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores document embeddings for Dify RAG retrieval inside the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-milvus","from":"ack","to":"milvus","label":"vectors"}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"Company documents","group":"frankfurt","why":"Holds company files that Dify ingests into the knowledge base."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-oss","from":"ack","to":"oss","label":"read docs"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding RDS for Dify metadata, Tair for caching, NAT for outbound API calls, and SLS for logs."}
{"t":"node","id":"rds","product":"rds","label":"Dify metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"PostgreSQL storing Dify workflows, apps and conversation history."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-rds","from":"ack","to":"rds","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and rate-limit counters for Dify."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Gives ACK pods outbound internet access to reach Model Studio APIs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-nat","from":"ack","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"frankfurt","why":"Centralizes Dify application and access logs for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-format","text":"What format are most of your company documents?","options":["PDF and Word","HTML and Markdown","Mixed formats"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth-method","text":"How should employees authenticate to the assistant?","options":["SSO via IDaaS","Dify built-in login","No auth yet"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt with Model Studio for Qwen, OSS for documents, Milvus for RAG, RDS, Tair, NAT and SLS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a product catalog API behind ESA and ALB, with ECS app servers, RDS for data, Tair cache, and OSS for images."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing marketplace API","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k daily active users","alt":"Over 100k daily active users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace users","group":"internet","why":"Buyers and sellers calling the catalog API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches product images and accelerates API calls globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes API requests across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks injection and bot attacks on the API."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"API servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the product catalog API in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales API servers during traffic spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Product data goes to RDS, hot lookups to Tair, and images to OSS."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Catalog cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches frequent product lookups to reduce DB load."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Product DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores product metadata, prices and inventory."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product photos served through ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"fetch"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Outbound internet for API calls to third parties."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-nat","from":"app","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes API access logs and alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"search-need","text":"Do you need full-text product search? Without Elasticsearch, we can use AnalyticDB or OpenSearch instead.","options":["Yes, add search","No, simple queries only"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"seller-upload","text":"Do sellers upload images directly, or only through your API servers?","options":["Direct to OSS via STS","Through API servers only"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API with ESA, ALB plus WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache, RDS database, and OSS image storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add AnalyticDB for fast full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions, avoiding Elasticsearch per your policy."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"analyticdb","label":"Product search","group":"vpc","why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-search","from":"app","to":"search","label":"query"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-search","from":"db","to":"search","label":"sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"rec","product":"dts","fit":"complement","why":"Keeps AnalyticDB in sync with RDS product data via change data capture."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AnalyticDB for full-text and fuzzy product search, syncing from RDS, while respecting the Elasticsearch ban."}

{"t":"say","text":"日本国内の規制に従い、すべてのデータを東京リージョンに保持するクレームポータルを設計します。"}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing portal for policyholders","alt":"Internal only via corporate network"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k policyholders","alt":"Over 100k policyholders"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"保険金請求を行う契約者。"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"ポータルドメインをESAに解決する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"静的コンテンツをキャッシュし、DDoSやボットから保護する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"2つのAZにトラフィックを分散する。"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"インジェクション攻撃や不正アクセスをブロックする。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"クレーム申請ロジックを2AZで実行する。"}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"請求集中時にサーバーを自動追加する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"クレームデータはRDSへ、添付書類はOSSへ保存し、すべて東京リージョン内に留まります。"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"クレーム情報を2AZ構成で安全に保管する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Document storage","group":"tokyo","why":"契約者の提出書類を東京リージョン内のOSSに保存する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"files"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"監査ログとシステムログを東京に一元管理する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth-method","text":"契約者の認証方式はどうしますか？","options":["IDaaS (SSO/MFA)","既存のID基盤と連携","シンプルなID/パスワード"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-review","text":"提出書類の確認にAI解析（OCR等）が必要ですか？","options":["はい、必要です","いいえ、手動確認のみ"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"東京リージョン完結の保険金請求ポータル：ESA、ALB(WAF)、ECS(Auto Scaling)、RDS、OSS、SLS。"}

{"t":"say","text":"東京のデータ residency 要件により、保険契約者データをシンガポールへ複製することはできません。"}
{"t":"say","text":"代わりに、匿名化・集計済みのレポートデータのみをDTSで同期する構成を提案します。"}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"sg-vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Analytics VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS sync","group":"tokyo","why":"匿名化したクレームデータを東京からシンガポールへ同期"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-dts","from":"db","to":"dts","label":"CDC"}
{"t":"node","id":"analytics-db","product":"rds","label":"Reporting DB","group":"sg-vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"匿名化済みデータの分析用レプリカ（個人データなし）"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-analytics-db","from":"dts","to":"analytics-db","label":"sync"}
{"t":"node","id":"bi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Dashboards","group":"sg","why":"シンガポールの分析チーム向けレポートダッシュボード"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-analytics-db-bi","from":"analytics-db","to":"bi","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"done","summary":"データ residency 制約のため生データは東京に保持し、匿名化データのみDTS経由でシンガポールのRDSへ同期してQuick BIで可視化します。"}

{"t":"say","text":"ポータルにQwenチャットボットを追加します。東京リージョンのModel Studio APIを使用し、データは日本国内に留まります。"}
{"t":"plan","products":["model-studio"]}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen chatbot","group":"tokyo","why":"回答生成のために東京リージョンでホストされたQwenモデルを呼び出します。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-llm","from":"app","to":"llm","label":"API"}
{"t":"done","summary":"東京リージョンのModel Studio経由でQwenチャットボットをポータルに追加しました。保険契約者データはすべて日本国内に保持されます。"}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a hardened live-streaming architecture with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing traffic before ESA, then ALB to app servers and cache."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","anti-ddos-proxy","esa","alb","waf","ecs","tair","live","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 50k concurrent viewers","alt":"Over 500k concurrent viewers"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers","group":"internet","why":"Audience watching live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves platform domain to Anti-DDoS Proxy."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge defense","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"anti-ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubs large L3-L7 DDoS attacks before ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-antiddos","from":"users","to":"anti-ddos","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets, accelerates dynamic API calls."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-antiddos-esa","from":"anti-ddos","to":"esa","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across app servers in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs streaming platform backend in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions and hot metadata for low latency."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding ApsaraVideo Live for stream ingest and processing, plus OSS for recordings and SLS for centralized logging."}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and delivers live video streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-live","from":"app","to":"live","label":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Recordings storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores recorded streams and static media assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"record"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes access logs and security events."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-logs","from":"alb","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"stream-protocol","text":"Which ingest protocol do your broadcasters use?","options":["RTMP","SRT","WebRTC"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"viewer-region","text":"Where are most of your viewers located?","options":["Southeast Asia","Worldwide","China mainland"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming platform with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing into ESA, ALB with WAF, dual-zone ECS app servers, Tair cache, and ApsaraVideo Live."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw your on-premises app servers connected privately to managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL in Jakarta via Express Connect."}
{"t":"req","text":"Databases stay in Jakarta region","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"req","text":"No public internet exposure for databases"}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","mongodb","rds"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"db-ha","text":"Both databases deployed across zones A and B for HA","alt":"Single zone deployment"}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"Your data center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"onprem-dc","label":"App servers","group":"onprem","why":"Runs the SaaS application logic on-premises."}
{"t":"group","id":"jkt","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Database VPC","parent":"jkt"}
{"t":"node","id":"express","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"vpc","why":"Dedicated private line from your DC to Jakarta VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-express","from":"app","to":"express","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"mongo","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores document data with no public endpoint."}
{"t":"node","id":"pg","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores relational data with no public endpoint."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-mongo","from":"express","to":"mongo","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-pg","from":"express","to":"pg","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"ask","id":"bandwidth","text":"What dedicated bandwidth do you need between your data center and Jakarta?","options":["100 Mbps","1 Gbps","10 Gbps"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"backup-region","text":"Do you need a disaster-recovery replica of these databases in another region?","options":["No, Jakarta only","Yes, Singapore","Yes, other region"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-premises app servers reach managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL in Jakarta over a private Express Connect link with no internet exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind an ALB, RDS for metadata, and OSS for images. No Function Compute."}
{"t":"req","text":"Company policy forbids serverless functions; no Function Compute","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ecs","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing photo app","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k users","alt":"Over 100k users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App users","group":"internet","why":"Users uploading and viewing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes HTTP traffic across ECS instances."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing backend on ECS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data and photo metadata in RDS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Photo storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores uploaded images durably in OSS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"objects"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes application logs for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How should users view the shared photos?","options":["Directly from OSS via pre-signed URLs","Through a CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"db-engine","text":"Which database engine do you prefer?","options":["MySQL","PostgreSQL"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend with ECS behind ALB, RDS for metadata, and OSS for image storage, without Function Compute."}

{"t":"say","text":"Since Function Compute is forbidden, I'll add a dedicated ECS worker that polls OSS to generate thumbnails on upload."}
{"t":"req","text":"Company policy forbids serverless functions; no Function Compute","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"node","id":"thumb-worker","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail workers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Polls OSS for new uploads and generates thumbnails without using serverless functions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-thumb-worker-images","from":"thumb-worker","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-thumb-worker-db","from":"thumb-worker","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How should users view the shared photos?","options":["Directly from OSS via pre-signed URLs","Through a CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"db-engine","text":"Which database engine do you prefer?","options":["MySQL","PostgreSQL"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a two-zone ECS thumbnail worker that reads new photos from OSS and writes thumbnails back, avoiding Function Compute per your policy."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 이용자 데이터를 서울 리전에 유지하는 게임 서버 아키텍처를 구성하겠습니다."}
{"t":"req","text":"이용자 개인정보 해외 반출 금지, 서울 리전 필수","regions":["ap-northeast-2"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"game-type","text":"웹 또는 모바일 기반 온라인 게임","alt":"패키지 다운로드형 게임"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"동시 접속자 약 1만 명 규모","alt":"동시 접속자 10만 명 이상"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"인터넷","parent":null}
